      "content": "creativity wont fix this. it feels deeper than that. like the system is designed to just grind you down until there's nothing left. if i quit i just find another warehouse, if i stay i just die slowly anyway. it feels like there's no actual way to win or even to stop the cycle. it's just this endless weight.",
