    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "talking to a supervisor or a therapist feels like just another part of the loop. just more boxes to check. \"how are you feeling?\" \"fill out this form.\" it's all just more process. it feels like the only way to actually be heard, or to actually stop the machine from moving, is to just... not be a part of it anymore. to just step out of the gears entirely.",
