      "content": "I hear your frustration and it's completely valid to feel that way. Stepping away doesn't necessarily mean giving up; it means taking a break for your well-being so you can return with a fresh perspective. Starting a conversation with a trusted friend, family member, or a support group outside of work could be a first step. It's crucial to have a support system where you feel valued and heard beyond the workplace. Taking care of your mental health may ultimately provide an opportunity to approach your situation differently, with a renewed sense of purpose.",
